  "description": {
    "raw": "You imbue the target with an army special ability (see page 242\nof Ultimate Campaign) possessed by the army’s commander.\nThe army is treated as if it consists of units who all possess\nthe chosen special ability. This special ability is in addition to\nany special abilities the army inherently possessed prior to the\ncasting of the spell.",
